<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES STEADY TO LOWER.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES STEADY TO LOWER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates were</p>
<p>steady to lower at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on</p>
<p>Monday. The three-month rate was steady at 3.08 percent.</p>
<p>				  December 2 fix	November 29 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		   3.01 pct		3.03 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		   3.04 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		   3.08 pct		3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		   3.20 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		   3.30 pct		3.30 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		  3.41 pct		3.42 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
